{"4629890": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "SHOWHAND", "steam_appid": 4629890, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4629890/extras/15c9e7b0902e6fad5bbfced7d50a3e29.poster.avif?t=1787495853\" width=700 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4629890/extras/15c9e7b0902e6fad5bbfced7d50a3e29.webm?t=1787495853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4629890/extras/15c9e7b0902e6fad5bbfced7d50a3e29.mp4?t=1787495853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Power Up Your Projectiles with Poker Hands</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As enemies close in from every side, card projectiles fire nonstop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The hand you build empowers your attacks.<br>The stronger the poker hand, the harder your projectiles hit — and the more of the screen they cover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the swarm fills the screen,<br>a well-built hand carves a path through the chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4629890/extras/4d05ec3cd188c133b89972bec61f15fb.poster.avif?t=1787495853\" width=700 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4629890/extras/4d05ec3cd188c133b89972bec61f15fb.webm?t=1787495853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4629890/extras/4d05ec3cd188c133b89972bec61f15fb.mp4?t=1787495853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Your Hands Strategically </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collecting cards blindly will not keep you alive.<br>You must decide what to hold, what to drop, and what hand to chase next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play it safe with a Pair,<br>push for a Straight or Flush,<br>or bet big on a higher hand for a bigger payoff.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In SHOWHAND, your hand is more than your attack.<br>It is your health, your build, and the strategy that decides your next fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4629890/extras/49416881e3eac80d3f8a63282d50574d.poster.avif?t=1787495853\" width=700 height=392 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4629890/extras/49416881e3eac80d3f8a63282d50574d.webm?t=1787495853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4629890/extras/49416881e3eac80d3f8a63282d50574d.mp4?t=1787495853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Break Through the Boss and Take On a Bigger Table</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive the endless waves,<br>and a powerful boss will stand in your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Under crushing pressure,<br>the hands, Jokers, and upgrades you have built will reveal their true power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Protect your hand to the very end,<br>break through the boss, and step up to a bigger table.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4629890/extras/15c9e7b0902e6fad5bbfced7d50a3e29.poster.avif?t=1787495853\" width=700 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4629890/extras/15c9e7b0902e6fad5bbfced7d50a3e29.webm?t=1787495853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4629890/extras/15c9e7b0902e6fad5bbfced7d50a3e29.mp4?t=1787495853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Power Up Your Projectiles with Poker Hands</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As enemies close in from every side, card projectiles fire nonstop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The hand you build empowers your attacks.<br>The stronger the poker hand, the harder your projectiles hit — and the more of the screen they cover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the swarm fills the screen,<br>a well-built hand carves a path through the chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4629890/extras/4d05ec3cd188c133b89972bec61f15fb.poster.avif?t=1787495853\" width=700 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4629890/extras/4d05ec3cd188c133b89972bec61f15fb.webm?t=1787495853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4629890/extras/4d05ec3cd188c133b89972bec61f15fb.mp4?t=1787495853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Your Hands Strategically </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collecting cards blindly will not keep you alive.<br>You must decide what to hold, what to drop, and what hand to chase next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play it safe with a Pair,<br>push for a Straight or Flush,<br>or bet big on a higher hand for a bigger payoff.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In SHOWHAND, your hand is more than your attack.<br>It is your health, your build, and the strategy that decides your next fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4629890/extras/49416881e3eac80d3f8a63282d50574d.poster.avif?t=1787495853\" width=700 height=392 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4629890/extras/49416881e3eac80d3f8a63282d50574d.webm?t=1787495853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4629890/extras/49416881e3eac80d3f8a63282d50574d.mp4?t=1787495853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Break Through the Boss and Take On a Bigger Table</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive the endless waves,<br>and a powerful boss will stand in your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Under crushing pressure,<br>the hands, Jokers, and upgrades you have built will reveal their true power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Protect your hand to the very end,<br>break through the boss, and step up to a bigger table.</p>", "short_description": "SHOWHAND is a roguelite that blends poker deckbuilding with top-down bullet-heaven action. Build your hand, strengthen your projectiles with poker hands, and break through waves of enemies and bosses. Your hand is your health—lose your cards, and your survival falls apart.", "supported_languages": "English, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Traditional Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Korean, Russian, Spanish - Latin America, Simplified Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4629890/1b570672b6d53fa9e59a0afb96a9033f5bd5350a/header.jpg?t=1787495853", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4629890/9fedb57c26e462dd9200b105ac3166b2c680807d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787495853", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamst